Pathfinder patch for jaq 3.1.0: Report an uncaught error and go on to the next input, as jq 1.8.1.

The 3.1.0 cut of 0008-uncaught-errors.patch: 3.1.0 spells the lines it replaces in real_main differently. Carried in-tree (Steelbore Standard 4.2, 6.4); not sent upstream.

